    <h1>Jack and the Beanstalk</h1>
    <p>Jack sells the family cow at the market in exchange for magic beans. The beans grow into a giant beanstalk that leads up into the sky. <strong>Jack climbs the beanstalk</strong> and finds a giant who tries to chase him. <em>Eventually</em>, Jack manages to get away, and he even steals the giant's treasure in the process. <mark>He escapes with treasure.</mark></p>
